        "original_id": "a6578f40-9df9-518e-aa4e-083d13e3b761",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Morris, John Belushi, Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English\n- TV shows: Saturday Night Live, Martin, The Jamie Foxx Show\n- Companies: NBC, Fox\n\nFacts:\n- Garrett Morris was born on February 1, 1937, and he is an American comedian and actor.\n- Garrett Morris was part of the original cast of NBC's sketch comedy program Saturday Night Live from 1975 to 1980.\n- John Belushi was one of the seven original cast members of NBC's sketch comedy show Saturday Night Live.\n- Martin is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from August 27, 1992, to May 1, 1997.\n- Garrett Morris played Stan Winters in the sitcom Martin from 1992 to 1995.\n- The Jamie Foxx Show stars Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, and Garrett Morris.",
